# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Corpus
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source documents are large and re-downloadable. The generated indexes
# (vectors_*.npz/.json, bm25_*.pkl, knowledge_graph.json, corpus_manifest.json)
# ARE the deployable corpus and stay tracked — see backend/data/*/README.md.
backend/data/incidents/*
!backend/data/incidents/README.md
backend/data/regulatory/*
!backend/data/regulatory/README.md

# Model weights, downloaded on first use
backend/data/fastembed/
backend/data/flashrank/

